{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/437bafe758260388a1c34682b81be232.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=800 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/437bafe758260388a1c34682b81be232.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cronos: The New Dawn is a brutal third-person survival horror where you fight for the future by salvaging the past. Burn monsters before they merge. Extract souls from the living. Adapt or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/4b2581ebfe1156ada1be3f41459bde30.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/b8184442b11cd14d8dea4026ef7fc2f9.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=780 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/b8184442b11cd14d8dea4026ef7fc2f9.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a grim world where Eastern European brutalism meets retro-futurist technology, Cronos: The New Dawn lets you experience a gripping story that straddles the line between past and future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the past, you will witness a world in the throes of The Change, a cataclysmic event that forever altered humanity. Meanwhile, in the ravaged wastelands of the future, every moment is a fight for survival against dangerous abominations that will test both your reflexes and your tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Traveler working for the enigmatic Collective, tasked with scouring the wastelands of the future in search of time rifts that will transport you to 1980s-era Poland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/5e48f5bed611ad3bfe85e11b0d540d23.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/1c5d79321f18a136fdd47227615939ca.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=780 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/1c5d79321f18a136fdd47227615939ca.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate world filled with ever-present danger, your survival hinges on your ability to strategize and plan ahead. The enemies you\u2019ll encounter are nightmarish creatures, born from the remnants of humanity \u2013 defeating them will require you to make full use of your arsenal.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manipulate temporal Anomalies to clear a path through the desolate environment, and will have to scavenge for resources to replenish your limited ammo and supplies. Good preparation is key. Once in battle, split-second decisions can mean the difference between life<br> and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/44c46f52781b4ba1d4a9e6e1f57cc9a2.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/6a79cf364a81183d460802bb087df117.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=800 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/6a79cf364a81183d460802bb087df117.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures you kill won\u2019t stay dead for long. Fallen enemies can be absorbed by others \u2014 through a grotesque process called Merging \u2014 to become faster, tougher, and far deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to stop them? Burn their bodies. And do it fast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t, you\u2019ll face ever-evolving abominations that will push your combat skills to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/f7b3c590690bef96f61b7f9f775c2483.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/c43cce90f0e7ba1b0ef40889d8f48653.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=780 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/c43cce90f0e7ba1b0ef40889d8f48653.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to locate key people from the past who perished in the ensuing apocalypse. Using your all-powerful Harvester, you can extract their Essences and have them accompany you into the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be wary: these essences have a profound impact on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you carry, the more haunted your suit becomes \u2014 increasing your prowess on the battlefield but also bringing with them whispers in your ear and flickers into your vision, edging you ever closer to madness.<br> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Flicker Of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/416d55bbe2174889dd4631c50f7225f29ba6e11b.jpg"},{"name":"Better Than One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/60b9227d5ced577c731dde560f6fcede93a9c4f5.jpg"},{"name":"Counter-Gravity Traversal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/d4c7f999731bdc598980629703f314de85c02859.jpg"},{"name":"Do Travelers Dream Of Electric Sheep?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/69a3c96ad481e096725ab4a19716b19239716ac0.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Let Them Merge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/ed82e08950f99f75a666b967da7452c6063d9fad.jpg"},{"name":"Down With The Sickness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/b2d49e000d2dc72034d1f7c3ed7e81d22e606994.jpg"},{"name":"Efficiency Discipline","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/8253acd4e5123bcfa043b8aa5921eadbdc88c0af.jpg"},{"name":"Essence Aquired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/2f51c42f17a9f739d2085ce7dca2e19cc97fb45c.jpg"},{"name":"Fire. Spreading.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/a1aa3df24580306591fb5f243f8dd693da2dcff4.jpg"},{"name":"Fixing Things","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2101960/170c561aa485d364bbbd06d9eca2b9a59275601c.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101960?t=1771941927","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771941927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/a9c0e9e0e5ed7b191b8efc25d496003c4296bc76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771941927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/a9c0e9e0e5ed7b191b8efc25d496003c4296bc76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771941927","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3870690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/9e4ca1f03571157910214a82afd16f1d.avif?t=1771941927\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras_big/9e4ca1f03571157910214a82afd16f1d.avif?t=1771941927 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/437bafe758260388a1c34682b81be232.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=800 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/437bafe758260388a1c34682b81be232.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cronos: The New Dawn is a brutal third-person survival horror where you fight for the future by salvaging the past. Burn monsters before they merge. Extract souls from the living. Adapt or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/4b2581ebfe1156ada1be3f41459bde30.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/b8184442b11cd14d8dea4026ef7fc2f9.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=780 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/b8184442b11cd14d8dea4026ef7fc2f9.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a grim world where Eastern European brutalism meets retro-futurist technology, Cronos: The New Dawn lets you experience a gripping story that straddles the line between past and future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the past, you will witness a world in the throes of The Change, a cataclysmic event that forever altered humanity. Meanwhile, in the ravaged wastelands of the future, every moment is a fight for survival against dangerous abominations that will test both your reflexes and your tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Traveler working for the enigmatic Collective, tasked with scouring the wastelands of the future in search of time rifts that will transport you to 1980s-era Poland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/5e48f5bed611ad3bfe85e11b0d540d23.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/1c5d79321f18a136fdd47227615939ca.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=780 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/1c5d79321f18a136fdd47227615939ca.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desolate world filled with ever-present danger, your survival hinges on your ability to strategize and plan ahead. The enemies you\u2019ll encounter are nightmarish creatures, born from the remnants of humanity \u2013 defeating them will require you to make full use of your arsenal.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manipulate temporal Anomalies to clear a path through the desolate environment, and will have to scavenge for resources to replenish your limited ammo and supplies. Good preparation is key. Once in battle, split-second decisions can mean the difference between life<br> and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/44c46f52781b4ba1d4a9e6e1f57cc9a2.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/6a79cf364a81183d460802bb087df117.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=800 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/6a79cf364a81183d460802bb087df117.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures you kill won\u2019t stay dead for long. Fallen enemies can be absorbed by others \u2014 through a grotesque process called Merging \u2014 to become faster, tougher, and far deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to stop them? Burn their bodies. And do it fast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t, you\u2019ll face ever-evolving abominations that will push your combat skills to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/f7b3c590690bef96f61b7f9f775c2483.webp?t=1771941927\" width=616 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/c43cce90f0e7ba1b0ef40889d8f48653.poster.avif?t=1771941927\" width=780 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/extras/c43cce90f0e7ba1b0ef40889d8f48653.webm?t=1771941927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to locate key people from the past who perished in the ensuing apocalypse. Using your all-powerful Harvester, you can extract their Essences and have them accompany you into the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be wary: these essences have a profound impact on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you carry, the more haunted your suit becomes \u2014 increasing your prowess on the battlefield but also bringing with them whispers in your ear and flickers into your vision, edging you ever closer to madness.<br> </p>","developers":["Bloober Team"],"dlc":[3748540],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101960/68fa7b72da253c498b70cf74e475b4f5f4ac79eb/header.jpg?t=1771941927","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u201cCronos: The New Dawn\u201d and all related logos, characters, names, and related indicia are \u00a9 2024 Bloober Team S.A. Bloober Team is registered trademark of Bloober Team S.A. in US and/or other countries. All other copyrights and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. \u201cCronos: The New Dawn\u201d uses the Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the US and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, \u00a91998 \u2013 2024, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Wwise \u00a9 2006 \u2013 2024 Audiokinetic Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> x64 Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400F, Intel Core I5-8600K | Amd Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1080, or AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 5700-XT, or Intel\u00ae Arc\u2122 A770<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Linux compatible Audio Device</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> x64 Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K | Amd Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00aeRTX 3080, or AMD Radeon\u2122 RX6800 -XT, or Intel\u00ae Arc\u2122 B580 (allows for gameplay in 1080p)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Linux compati